    "text": "Net force on <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>40</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><br />And limiting friction on <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">μ</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo></math> System remain in equilibrium and friction on <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math>"
